OL,4,CTwo men dead after glider crashes into 
OL,5,CLoch Leven                             
OL,6,GTwo men have died after a glider       
OL,7,Gcrashed into Loch Leven.               
OL,9,FPolice, ambulance, fire service and    
OL,10,Fthe coastguard were called to the      
OL,11,Fscene near Kinross at about 11:00.     
OL,13,FThe Scottish Gliding Centre, which is  
OL,14,Fbased at Portmoak Airfield near the    
OL,15,Floch, said a two-seater Perkoz         
OL,16,Faircraft had "crashed whilst on a      
OL,17,Flocal training flight" but it was not  
OL,18,Fclear what had caused the crash.       
